    CFSG.LocalAnalysis.GLTheoremA.Y10GFldOrth.FOD.orthFieldDatum_minus (by norm_num : 1 ≤ 4)
      (hY.statedClassicalModel (by decide)) hr (by omega) (hθ ▸ pow_orderOf_eq_one θ)
